From 972f31cfe917a0d76ae568cba20c47390b55e2c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 06:38:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge Inicio + Nosotros into one MUEVETE tab, soften carousel
 edges

- Navbar collapses "Inicio" and "Nosotros" into a single "MUEVETE" tab
  pointing at /. /nosotros now redirects there.
- The Nosotros copy and its 6 photos moved onto the home page, right
  before the closing CTA band, each photo entering with a staggered
  zoom-in and a hover scale for a bit of life.
- The carousel now lives inside the dark hero band instead of a
  separate light section below it, with a radial mask that dissolves
  its edges into the ink background instead of a hard-edged box, plus
  a soft accent-tinted glow behind it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lnk4T93LH9WLa79FuvsXSG
